WEBVTT

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:04.700
Can I count on you this one time?

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.650
Of course, Your Greatness!

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.350
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.470
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:26.680
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:27.850
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:29.020
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.250
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:49.500
<b>Restoration Plan No. 19

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:49.080
<i>The blessings bestowed by mana crystals
 are different for everyone.</i>

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:52.170
<i>Some can create magical items,</i>

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.170
<i>some can enhance their powers.</i>

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.880
<i>My gift is wretched, abhorred by all.</i>

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.230
<i>That's what I used to think...</i>

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.210
<i>until I met the Great Jahy, that is.</i>

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:10.130
<i>I have the ability 
to manipulate people's hearts.</i>

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:14.280
<i>It was a power I resented.</i>

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:16.940
Don't look in her eyes!

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.740
She'll start controlling you!

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:25.640
<i>The more I used it, the more I was forced
 to reckon with the scorn for it.</i>

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:36.240
<i>I loathed it so that I voluntarily 
let go of my mana crystal.</i>

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:40.140
<i>Those who lose their powers 
are fated to disappear.</i>

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.610
<i>That's when...</i>

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.150
So you're Druj?

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:48.650
It would be a shame if you 
just disappeared like this.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.810
My name is Jahy.

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:57.960
In order to rule over the Dark Realm 
as the Demon Lord's right hand,

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.740
I need your power.

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:13.460
You might not remember it, Your Greatness.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:20.380
But for me, being needed...
being relied on...

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:26.470
That alone—that one thing—
made me happier than anything in my life.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.650
I see.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.260
<i>So I said something like that, huh?</i>

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:41.780
<i>Moreover, is now really
the time for this, Druj?</i>

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.210
And here in the human world, too...

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:45.660
You're still going?

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.490
All this time, I've been waiting...

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.330
Waiting for the day you'd count on me!

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:57.930
I was able to persevere here
  because I told myself

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.760
that it was all for that—for you.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:02.300
<i>That's right...</i>

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:07.810
<i>This why I wanted to make sure that 
I never shattered Druj's image of me.</i>

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:13.760
<i>She idolizes me and looks up to me
more than anyone else.</i>

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.600
You have my gratitude, Druj.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:26.030
Now, that's enough talk.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.490
Let's take that thing down together.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.580
We can reminisce later.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.170
Yes!

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.100
Huh?

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.060
It ran away?!

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.960
Because you just couldn't shut up!

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:45.680
I am so truly sorry!

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:46.920
Do we give chase?

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:48.340
Of course!

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:52.860
Wait, I can't feel even feel a 
hint of its presence anymore.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:58.240
So, Your Greatness...

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:58.980
Huh?

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:01.320
About catching up...

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:05.150
Want to go have a drink?

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.420
I'd love to!

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:13.040
<i>In the end, rather than identifying 
the mysterious glowing being,</i>

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.070
<i>they instead drank until dawn.</i>

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.340
Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b>

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:22.050
Another draft beer over here!

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:25.480
Hy-chan's been so energetic lately.

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:28.830
And you've gotten used to the job.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:33.110
Hy-chan, want to try your 
hand at food prep tomorrow?

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:33.810
Oh?

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:37.140
Why don't you try the kitchen?

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.090
Here you go.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:44.410
Wow, let's eat!

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:51.490
Mm! Delicious!

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:54.300
Jahy-kun made this...

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.540
It's too precious to eat.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.460
Eat it already.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:02.850
You've gotten so good with 
using knives and the stove.

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:07.470
This is nothing! I mean, I've been cooking 
for myself all this time to save money.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:10.910
It's so good, Jahy-kun!

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:14.790
Right? You could open 
your own place with this.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:16.930
My own place?

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.160
She's right!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.190
<i>My own place?</i>

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:23.690
<b>Pub Jahy</b>

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:25.690
<i>Jahoo, Jahoo!</i>

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:28.940
<i>Of course! How come I never thought of that?</i>

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:31.870
<i>If I'm the boss,</i>

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.860
<i>I won't be worked to the bone!</i>

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:36.160
<i>I'll keep all the profits!</i>

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:40.120
<i>Surely I've saved up enough
 to strike out on my own!</i>

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.670
<i>This is it!</i>

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:45.550
<i>I've found what I'm meant to do
 here in the human world!</i>

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:49.020
Hy-chan?

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:53.260
Now that I've decided,
 I'd better get started!

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:57.220
You're going to open your own place?

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.310
Indeed.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:02.160
Splendid! Please leave it all to me.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:06.370
I will make sure to find you
 the best location.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:10.810
Ah, Her Greatness needs me!

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:14.280
I shall answer with all 
my heart, body, and soul!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:16.530
I'll go do some research right away!

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.330
All right, next is...

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:28.010
I need to develop a menu that's even tastier 
than what the boss currently serves.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:34.470
But why the hell do I have 
to be your taste tester?

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.800
Because you know the boss's cooking best.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:42.270
I figure you can tell me if mine's a cut above.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:47.630
Yeah, maybe, but suddenly 
striking out on your own like this...

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:51.240
You really want to quit my sister's place?

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:56.990
Yeah. I mean, I <i>am</i> 
the Dark Realm's second-in-command.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:01.380
Someone like me getting ordered around 
in that hole in the wall is absurd.

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:07.180
Besides, she has the magical girl now.
It's no big deal if I'm not there.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:13.560
Right! What do you say 
to working at my new place?

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:16.180
It's a good chance for you to get 
some independence from the boss.

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:18.200
I'll pass.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:21.380
Hey! You haven't even tasted anything!

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:32.440
What's her problem? 
I was gonna serve her this delicious meal!

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:38.620
<i>You're Jahy-chan, so "Hy-chan" for short.</i>

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.640
<i>Please take those to the folks at table five.</i>

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.750
<i>Turn around.</i>

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:45.720
<i>Good job.</i>

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.400
It's decent.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:05.770
Druj will find a location for me, 
and I've come up with a menu.

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.230
Next...

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:12.400
Hy-chan!

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:16.250
Is it really true? You're striking out
to open your own place?

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:17.890
Yeah.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:18.990
Oh, dear...

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.820
Why didn't you tell me about it?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.540
I would have helped you!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.210
You're not angry?

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:32.400
Why would I be?

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:35.540
Of course I'm sad to see you go,

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.730
but if it's something you really want,

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:40.100
I'll support you regardless,

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:43.590
whether it's gathering mana crystals 
or opening your own place.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:48.520
I mean, at this point, 
we're practically family.

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:52.680
Boss!

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:58.050
Boss, behind you!

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.700
Do you want power?

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:03.500
What?

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.330
Let's see... Yes!

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:08.870
I want the power to support Hy-chan.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:11.340
Then I shall bestow it.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.510
Boss!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:28.390
Damn it!

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:32.110
Oh, my.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.050
Oh, me! Oh, my!

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.730
Oh, my!

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:36.320
So...

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:39.530
I'm the Magical Girl of Love.

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.250
Just kidding!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.440
Um...

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.110
Oh, goodness, I'm so sorry.

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:48.640
I didn't mean to get so carried away.

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:51.290
Now, who might you be?

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:53.630
Boss?!

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:57.550
That form...

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:01.260
The gray eminence got her!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:05.100
You mean the voice of the light?!

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:10.220
That's right. She answered 
the voice of the light and...

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:13.310
turned into this horrible...

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.350
this horrible...

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:20.690
Is it that bad?!

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:23.460
I guess I really am too old 
to wear something like this.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.930
I don't know if that's the problem...

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:29.250
Uh, can we...

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.300
Oh, excuse me.

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:34.330
What exactly is it you need?

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:37.420
Don't do it, Boss! Don't listen to that thing!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:44.390
<i>The boss has turned into a magical girl, 
which means she's... my enemy now?</i>

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:49.560
Go and take their mana crystals!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:50.800
What'd you say?!

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.890
I knew that's what it wants!

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:55.180
That's...

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.040
That's not nice!

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.260
It's bad to take other people's things!

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:03.160
What?

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:07.380
B-Bad? But it's better for the humans,

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:10.120
and things will get messy if I don't...

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.670
Is that so?

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:15.530
Well, if you have your reasons,
then you need to talk it out properly.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:17.450
I wanted to, but...

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:21.030
The mana crystal's aren't yours, are they?

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:23.470
It's wrong to take them.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:25.680
Why?

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:30.180
Why am I being scolded?!

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.600
Why do things never ever

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.560
go my way?!

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:35.160
I'm...

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:36.650
I'm the real...

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:39.520
Justice!

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:44.070
She looks just like the Demon Lord!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:46.490
What does this mean?

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:49.280
If you won't give me the mana crystals...

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:51.540
I'll take them by force!

00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:58.710
The Demon Lord?!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.500
What is this?

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.790
So huge! What is that?

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.840
Is this the Demon Lord's true form?!

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:45.220
Yeah. The Demon Lord is angry now.

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:47.130
She's facing off against the gray eminence.

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.220
There's no telling what will happen.

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:51.900
If we don't do something, 
the city is in big trouble!

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:53.870
Oh, no!

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.560
Boss, the gray eminence gave you power.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.880
Can't you use some kind of magic now?

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.520
Oh, that's right!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.310
Huh?

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:11.030
Oh, look, a flower!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:12.670
That's amazing!

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:13.860
<i>Not gonna cut it.</i>

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:14.910
Jahy-kun!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.080
This is bad! Run!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:27.920
Oh, no!

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.140
Hy-chan!

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.140
Jahy-kun!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.850
Are you okay, Jahy-kun?!

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:05.800
Yeah. But I couldn't protect the store.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:07.690
Kyouko.

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:12.300
Lend me your aid. Let us defend the city.

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:15.420
But of course!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.230
Leave this area to me!

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:30.900
Right!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:38.040
I'm worried about Her Greatness.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.460
Step on it!

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:42.710
Sis!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.020
Ryou-chan!

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.420
What is this?

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:53.430
Boss, Landlord, you two need 
to evacuate the citizens.

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:55.770
But what about you?

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:56.560
I...

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:59.560
I'm going to stop those two!

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:01.720
This place...

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.060
This city...

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:05.800
Hy-chan!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:05.800
Ja-ko!

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:07.110
This is my precious...

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:09.530
Jahy-kun!

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:15.620
Stop it already!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.210
Hy-chan!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:34.920
Jahy-kun...

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:36.680
Jahy-kun?

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.220
Jahy-kun!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:47.110
Hey... You gotta be kidding me, Ja-ko.

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:50.570
No, this can't be, Hy-chan!

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.100
I didn't mean to...

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:00.240
Why?

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.680
Why does nothing ever go right?

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.540
What the hell are you trying to do?

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.330
Why did you do this?!

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:13.030
I didn't meant to hurt anyone.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:14.840
I just wanted...

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:19.760
I just wanted my big sister 
to pay attention to me.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:22.470
What?

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:27.250
Originally, the two of us lived together.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:31.940
But then my big sister created the 
Dark Realm and shut herself away there.

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:39.330
So I was wondering if she was okay.
 I thought I could surprise her.

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:43.120
That's why I asked the magical girl for help...

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:44.590
Me?

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:48.710
But she was way stronger than I intended...

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:50.860
She ended up destroying the Dark Realm

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:55.510
and shattering my sister. And since 
the mana crystals are bad for humans,

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.720
I made them smaller and asked 
the magical girl to quietly collect them all.

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:02.600
I wanted to apologize to my big sister.

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:08.260
But then the magical girl 
gave the crystals to someone else.

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:13.230
When I tried to recruit other people,
all the magical girls I got were worthless.

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:15.320
Teehee!

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:19.890
When I'm not possessing someone 
with a strong sense of justice,

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.040
I can only say certain set phrases.

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:26.730
Since I can't appear in the human world
 or the Dark Realm like this,

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.920
I couldn't do anything by myself either.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.430
I never meant for any of this to happen...

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:39.160
<i>Wait a second.</i>

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:40.470
<i>Hang on.</i>

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:45.180
<i>I ended up like this
 because of a sibling fight?</i>

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:49.440
<i>It was over something so stupid?</i>

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:52.650
<i>Everything that happened 
to me was because of </i>that<i>?!</i>

00:18:58.190 --> 00:19:00.410
Don't mess with me!

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:03.620
Jahy-kun!

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:06.590
Apologize! Right now! Apologize!

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:12.290
I-I'm so sorry, Big Sister.

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:17.970
Big Sister...

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.450
No! Apologize to me, too!

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:23.550
I-I know that.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:25.620
I'm sorry.

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:27.970
Look me in the eye and say that!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.280
I'm sorry.

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:30.520
I can't hear you!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.520
I'm sorry!

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:34.270
You think "sorry" is gonna cut it, you moron?!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.110
Well, what do you want me to do?

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:42.070
There, there, Hy-chan.
 No one got hurt thanks to Kyouko-chan.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.780
And other than the shop,
there was no collateral damage.

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:49.820
We can all fix up the pub together.

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:51.870
I'm sorry.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.800
Don't forgive her, Boss!

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:56.950
She wrecked your precious pub!

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:59.080
Of course the pub is important to me,

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:02.010
but more than anything, 
I'm just relieved you're safe.

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:07.060
You put yourself on the line
 to defend the city.

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:12.520
To defend us. And for that, 
I thank you, Hy-chan.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.730
Please don't be that reckless again, though.

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:19.640
Sure.

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:27.500
I can fix up the pub with everyone's help,

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:30.570
but there's nothing I can do
 about the Dark Realm.

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:38.340
So if you two have made up, you should 
help Hy-chan with that too, okay, um...

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:40.170
Su.

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:41.550
Su-chan!

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:44.870
Do you understand, Su-chan?

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:45.800
Yes.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:49.520
Wait.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:53.060
Are you just trying to sweep 
this all under the rug?!

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:56.040
<i>The identity of the gray 
eminence was unveiled,</i>

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:59.580
<i>the reason for the Dark Realm's
 destruction was revealed.</i>

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:03.070
<i>and the Demon Lord reconciled
 with her younger sister. But...</i>

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:05.280
Great Jahy, are you all right?

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:06.360
You're hurt?!

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:09.040
I knew it! The gray eminence got you and...

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:10.580
Oh, how horrible!

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:14.630
I didn't make it on time.

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:17.580
This is all because I was late!

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:22.300
I am such a useless worm of an underling!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:25.810
I couldn't protect Her Greatness
in her hour of need!

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:28.690
I'll... I'll never forgive myself!

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:32.310
You were beaten to an absolute pulp!

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:33.200
I-It's really not that bad...

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:35.020
Wait, it is!

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:35.620
This my fault!

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:39.610
That's right! So many terrible things 
have happened to me.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:42.980
I will never <i>ever</i> forgive you for this!

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:48.420
<i>The Great Jahy wasn't satisfied
 with this outcome!</i>

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:23.920
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:23.920
<b>The Great Jahy Will NOT Be Defeated!</b>
